+++ b/Documentation/userspace-api/media/v4l/pixfmt-yuv-planar.rst
@@ -173,6 +173,13 @@ All components are stored with the same number of bits per component.
       - Cb, Cr
       - Yes
       - Linear
+    * - V4L2_PIX_FMT_P210
+      - 'P210'
+      - 10
+      - 4:2:2
